      "valence": "Positive",
      "description": "When a unit where all models have this rule is deployed or activated, pick one effect until the unit\u0027s next activation: when shot or charged from over 9 inches away, it either gets \u002B1 to defense rolls, or enemies get -1 to hit rolls against it."
